--- !u!114 &7802360828412978801
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8468638327070227677}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 724695e00d25c4e36b4a29b53f66a005, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpaceGame.World.WorkshopFamilyMember
  arriveRadius: 1.2
  greetRadius: 14
  focusSeconds: 4
  hearingRadius: 30
  secondsPerLine: 4
  gathering:
  - You opened it! We thought we'd never see the sky again.
  - They came in the night - we hid in the loft while they tore the place apart.
  hunting:
  - Please, bring our Heart Gear back. The engines won't turn without it.
  - One of them had a limp. Can't have got far with a cog that heavy.
  - They went out the ship lane. Look for what they dropped - that old cart of theirs
    was falling apart.
  carrying:
  - You've got it! Take it to the middle of the hall!
  vault:
  - Our vault's past the turning rooms. Grandmother hid it well - you'll have to
    turn a few to find it.
  - Mind the hoist when you lower the core. Gently does it, or you'll dent your own
    ship.
  afterwards:
  - Hear that hum? That's the Heart Gear turning again.
  - You're a friend of this workshop now. Never forget it.
